    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44554" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνο-ϊκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>welldisposed, kindly, favourable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνοϊκωτέρους ὑπάρχειν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					57.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Amphis
				1
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατος</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, περὶ τοὺς οἰκείους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					49.16
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνοϊκῶς, ἔχειν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.4.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.6.34
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1436b18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. διακεῖσθαι πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.237
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					810.25
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Nero</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. ἀκοῦσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. προσδέχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.7
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωτέρως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				51.2
			</span></i>; -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτερον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				49.31
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.4.1
			</span></i>.</div>
